<title>USA: First Republic Bancorp retains banker.</title>
<headline>First Republic Bancorp retains banker.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Republic Bancorp Inc Tuesday said it retained Montgomery Securities to assist in identifying, reviewing and assessing various strategic alternatives.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the alternatives include the possibility of being acquired or merging with a strategic partner.</p>
<p>The company said it would also consider other alternatives that would enhance shareholder value.</p>
</text>
